OL,3,AUK-Iranian dual national arrested over
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK-Iranian dual national has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of preparation of
OL,8,Fterrorist acts in connection with the
OL,9,Fincident at RAF Fairford,
OL,10,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,12,FThe 25-year-old man was arrested in
OL,13,FWestminster, London. Two properties in
OL,14,Fthe area have been searched.
OL,16,FFive men in their twenties who were
OL,17,Farrested near the Gloucestershire
OL,18,Fairbase on Sunday remain on police
OL,19,Fbail. All five were UK nationals from
OL,20,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
