OL,3,AUK-Iranian dual national arrested over
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounter-terror police are considering
OL,7,F"all possible angles - including
OL,8,Fforeign state involvement", the force's
OL,9,Fsenior national coordinator Vicki Evans
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
