OL,3,ASeoul warns 'further action' if Ukraine
OL,4,Adoes not apologise over prisoner-of-war
OL,5,Arow
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's Foreign Minister Andrii
OL,8,FSybiha on Thursday described the
OL,9,Fsituation as a "diplomatic
OL,10,Fmisunderstanding", adding that Kyiv was
OL,11,F"working" to resolve it.
OL,13,FLee rejected this characterisation on
OL,14,FX, saying it concerned "the dignity of
OL,15,Fthe Korean people and the nation".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
